 "name": "elevator-2floor",
 "description": "Two-floor elevator control: call up (S1) / call down (S2) latch their contactors (KM1 up, KM2 down) with seal-in aux contacts; top/bottom limit switches (S3/S4) stop the car at the ends; NC aux cross-interlock (KM1 21-22 in the down path, KM2 21-22 in the up path) prevents both contactors ever energizing together; thermal overload KK1 protects the hoist motor. Simulate arrival by pressing the limit switch.",
